Student Performance Prediction Using Machine Learning

Project Overview
This beginner-level project uses machine learning to predict student academic performance based on study hours, attendance, and previous marks.

Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib

Key Features
- Student data analysis
- Data visualisation
- Linear Regression model
- Model evaluation using MAE and R-squared
- Prediction of marks for a new student

Dataset
This initial version uses a small illustrative dataset created for learning purposes.

How to Run
Open the Jupyter notebook in Google Colab and execute the cells in order.

Future Improvements
Analyse a larger real-world dataset and compare machine learning algorithms.
